  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thanks, Owen, you're verified. I've looked at order 7601 from Pho Real.\n\nThe courier handed the order over at 6:41 PM, and our records show 2 beef pho ($15.00 each) in the order. I can compensate the missing one in one of two ways:\n\n1. **Refund to your Visa ending 4242: $12.00.** Your order had a WELCOME10 promo, so the pho's share of that discount ($3.00) isn't refunded to your card.\n2. **Account credit: $18.00.** This is the pho's full price plus 20%, usable on future Forkful orders.\n\nWhich would you prefer?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "I'd prefer the refund to my card. I didn't know the promo would come off the refund though. Can you explain why the $3 comes out? I don't remember how much the code took off."
  },
