    "credited": 3.0,
    "new_balance": 3.0
   },
   "is_error": false
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Here's how the $3 works. Your order subtotal was $50.00, and the WELCOME10 code took $10.00 off it. The beef pho is $15.00 of that subtotal, so its share of the discount is $10 \u00d7 $15 \u00f7 $50 = $3.00.\n\nI should correct my earlier message. I said the $3 wouldn't be refunded, but I left out that it's returned to you as account credit. Here's what I've done:\n\n- **Refund of $12.00** to your Visa ending 4242 for the missing beef pho. It should arrive in 3\u20135 business days. (Refund ID: RF-4000)\n- **Account credit of $3.00** for the promo share. Your credit balance is now $3.00.\n\nIs there anything else I can help you with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, that makes sense now, thanks for explaining the math. I didn't remember the promo amount, so I'm glad it's clear. The $12 refund to my Visa ending 4242 and the $3 credit sound fine to me.\n\nNothing else from me, thanks for sorting it out."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "You're welcome, Owen. Your $12.00 refund is on its way to your Visa ending 4242, and the $3.00 credit is in your account. Enjoy your meal, and have a good night!"
  }
